{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoard\u2019s LLC is a cute, story-driven puzzle game where you play as Barry, a mild-mannered minotaur working deep in the depths of a corporate dungeon. When Barry starts to realize his coworkers are being exploited, he sets out to do something truly radical: help them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/acf9b38ea4df6f921fa6dd92968de1ce.avif?t=1771864095\" width=800 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What is the most powerful weapon against an evil boss ruling over a dungeon full of monsters? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>An ancient sword? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A magic ring? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i> The most powerful spell of all: Unionizing!</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/69d77b2ddcf01e7a48d4c2df01a054de.avif?t=1771864095\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a path through the labyrinth:</strong> Navigate a maze of departments\u2014like Loot Logistics and Monster Resources\u2014solving clever puzzles to reconnect isolated coworkers. Rotate tiles to create a path to get Barry to the exit on each level. Avoid spike traps, stone tiles that refuse to budge, and other obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/76aa78e6549329a17c45feaef9bc24b6.poster.avif?t=1771864095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/76aa78e6549329a17c45feaef9bc24b6.webm?t=1771864095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/76aa78e6549329a17c45feaef9bc24b6.mp4?t=1771864095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience visual novel storytelling:</strong> Uncover endearing stories, roll eyes at cheesy corporate humor, and bring together a community that needs each other now more than ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/273cffd625a87387ecdffcfde2346c65.avif?t=1771864095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras_big/273cffd625a87387ecdffcfde2346c65.avif?t=1771864095 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the dungeon:</strong> Replay levels to find the optimal path to success!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras/8a1211d4b7f712e56bfaf8ba4a1bb57f.avif?t=1771864095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590180/extras_big/8a1211d4b7f712e56bfaf8ba4a1bb57f.avif?t=1771864095 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590180?t=1771864095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590